OL,3,GNEWSAWhy will 425 new flats only have
OL,4,A22 car parking spaces?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a housing development of 425
OL,7,Fflats with car parking for just 22
OL,8,Fvehicles is likely to get under way
OL,9,Fsoon, after a detailed plan was given
OL,10,Fapproval.
OL,12,FThe build-to-rent scheme is on the
OL,13,Foutskirts of Cambridge, close to
OL,14,FCambridge North Railway Station and a
OL,15,Fguided busway.
OL,17,FAs a result, developers say the tenants
OL,18,Fwill have an "exceptional opportunity"
OL,19,Fto travel everywhere by public
OL,20,Ftransport, or walk or cycle.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
